i do/are something explained by a selbri.<br /><br />Identify the sumti a=
nd selbri equivalents in these jufra:<br />=E2=80=9CI will pick up my dau=
ghters with my car=E2=80=9D<br /><br />Answer: selbri: =E2=80=9Cpick up (=
