i)

se and its family can of course be combined with fa and its family. The r=
esult can be very confusing indeed, if you wish to make it so:
klama =3D =E2=80=9Cx1 travels/goes to x2 from x3 via x4 using x5 as trans=
portation device=E2=80=9D
fu lo zdani ku te klama fe do ti fa mi. =3D mi te klama do ti lo zdani ku=
 and since te exchanges x1 and x3: =3D ti klama do mi lo zdani ku
=E2=80=9CThis travels to you from me via a home.=E2=80=9D Of course, no o=
