=9CI wish you said you loved me=E2=80=9D
note: cu is not a terminator, because it is not tied to one specific cons=
truct. But it can be used to elide other terminators.

One of the greatest strengths of cu is that it quickly becomes easy to in=
tuitively understand. By itself it means nothing, but it reveals the stru=
