cmavo are small words with one or zero consonants. They tend to not signi=
fy anything in the exterior world, but to have only grammatical function.=
 Exceptions occur, and it=E2=80=99s debatable how much attitudinals exist=
s for their grammatical function. If you have been paying attention, you =
would already be familiar with {du}, one of the few cmavo with a place st=
