Note: Earlier, there was a word {xo=E2=80=99e} for the generic gadri. How=
ever, the rules and definitions for gadri were changed in late 2004, and =
the current set of rules nicked =E2=80=9Cxorlo=E2=80=9D has replaced the =
old way. Now, {lo} is generic, and {xo=E2=80=99e} has not yet found anoth=
