    {ju=E2=80=99a} does not change the truth value or subjective understa=
nding of the bridi or anything like that. In fact, it=E2=80=99s mostly do=
es nothing. However, {ju=E2=80=99a pei}, =E2=80=9CWhat is your basis for =
saying that?=E2=80=9D is handy.
    {do=E2=80=99i} is really useful. A lot of times when you refer to utt=
