aying two sentences: mi nelci lo=E2=80=99e cirla .i na ku mi nelci lo=E2=80=
=99e ckafi. This is how the function of logical connectives is defined.

By putting a =E2=80=9Cj=E2=80=9D in front of the core word of a logical c=
onnective, it connects two selbri. An example is mi ninmu na jo nanmu =E2=
